  "term": "dangerousness",
  "definition": "Dangerousness, in this context, means a person’s belief that their own thoughts are threatening or capable of causing harm. It is described as part of negative metacognitive beliefs about thoughts, alongside beliefs that thoughts are personally uncontrollable.",
